      "gearTypeSource": "Air-over-oil shock struts on the split-axle gear (Boeing/Stearman Model 75: oleo shock struts, unlike the shock-cord gear of its contemporaries). Telescopic, so no legPivot authored -- the split axle does swing, and nobody has measured where it hinges on this model.",
