  "cellule": {
    "liftInterference": true,
    "_source": "Derived biplane lift interference (BiplaneCellule: a Biot-Savart lattice on this config's own wings; Prandtl NACA Rep. 116, Munk NACA Rep. 151 General Biplane Theory 1923). ON because clarkY-like peaks at CLmax 1.480, a true 2-D Clark Y value, so the interference is not already in the table. Not a tuned number: nothing here is fitted to a stall speed."
