      "_unitsRule": "Ty 2026-11-10, asked what rule the other 27 types follow after settling five by hand, chose \"by era and category\": \"Vintage, fabric and experimental types read mph; anything certified modern or turbine reads knots.\" FlyingGame.Core.Instruments.AsiUnits carries the rule and the exceptions."
    }
